title: Graphite Page Component - Comprehensive Guide
description: Complete guide to understanding and working with Graphite Page components and their lifecycle
keywords: 'ibm,maximo,graphite,page,lifecycle,events,controller,navigation'
date: 05 November 2025
hiddenFromSearch: false
